- the pvoc robot's echoes give way to the voice's ANSWER, "everything comes round" on E1 at bars 101 and 109 - the storm's arithmetic in five words (presence -4.7 dB, the loudest thing at the crest). Whisper and the dry speech stay (not all singing).
- Tried and dropped: fading the D1 thump out by bar 112 (out-seam 38 Hz +22 -> +18 dB over t4) cost recurrence 2.6 and flow gained 0.5.
